<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="pre-raid-best-in-slot">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_dungeon_gloryofthehero.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Pre-Raid Best-in-Slot Gear for Discipline Priests</span></h2>This set uses items from multiple sources that you'll have access to before stepping foot in any raid - you won't see Phase 1 raid items on here either. While this gear may technically be the best available without raiding, it is unlikely that you will have or need all of these items before entering your first raid, and as you gain raid gear, your priorities will shift. We include a bunch of Valor items here, but if you're planning on raiding, then just getting a full Celestial set is more than sufficient and will save you long reputation grinds.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
<div class="exclude-units">
