<br/>[h3 type=bar toc="Dominance Offensive"]<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/pvpcurrency-honor-horde.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Dominance Offensive /<wbr/> Operation Shieldwall <span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/pvpcurrency-honor-alliance.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span>[/<wbr/>h3]<br/>The phase 2 faction offers some medium item-level valor pieces and a few trinkets. Nothing here is best-in-slot, and you won't wear it over Celestial gear. The prices are discounted in phase 3 but this isn't really sufficient.<br/>
<br/>
